      "text": "This morning I came from Ankara to Istanbul by train. I met my friends at the station; together we walked along the shore and drank tea in a small cafe. We talked about the book I had read during the journey and the work we would do next week. When I returned home in the evening, I organized my notes and shared what I had learned with my family.",
